WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:06.630
Sumimura Yoshimori, a junior high student,
and Yukimura Tokine, a high school student,

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:08.470
must guard the land
where their school now stands

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:10.370
to protect the Karasumori Site
from the Ayakashi.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:15.340
It is a duty passed down to them
from generation to generation.

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:21.480
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.350
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:28.560
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:30.460
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.900
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.300
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:41.840
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:45.170
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:50.840
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:55.340
Sha la la la la...

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:01.760
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:03.730
(Secret romance)

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:08.930
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:10.690
(A strange distance)

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:17.540
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.610
Yeah

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:22.080
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.680
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:31.020
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:00.440
You look awesome!

00:02:03.150 --> 00:02:06.380
He doesn't even flinch
seeing me like this.

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:09.120
Gen-kun, you're thinking of
charging in by yourself...

00:02:10.490 --> 00:02:12.650
...so we won't
get involved, right?

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:16.900
I'm not going to let you
do this alone!

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:21.800
I'll say this...
I'm the only one that can hurt him!

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.900
We'll back you up!
You do what you gotta do!

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:38.410
Looks like he's gonna release
that giant fireball.

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:40.140
Wait!

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:44.590
Attack him after he fires.
He'll be most vulnerable then.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.650
What about the fireball?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:50.630
Don't tell me you're going to
do something about it.

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:52.530
What do you mean by that?!

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:55.730
He broke through your Kekkai earlier.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:03:00.000
That was then. This won't be the same.

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:02.870
I'll bounce it back this time! I swear!

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:07.170
Don't think that you should be
the only one risking his life!

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:13.850
Suit yourself. I need to concentrate.
Stop talking to me.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:18.380
Why is this?

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:22.190
I've never felt so calm.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:27.460
Normally, I get confused
when I transform.

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:33.700
My mind and body go crazy,
as if I'd lost control.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:36.640
But it's different this time.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.070
My mind is clear and I can
move my body the way I want to.

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.910
I feel power surging inside me.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.160
So the egg hatched...

00:03:54.130 --> 00:04:00.400
A loyal servant will be born from it.
It'll look exactly like the owner of the egg.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.400
I'm sure that your servant
will look very ugly!

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.540
Is this it?

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:12.670
I have no anxiety or fear.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:20.910
This mind, body and power
are finally mine!

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:30.460
Very nice. This is making me excited.
You don't have to use any petty tricks!

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.570
Isn't this bad?

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.970
It's a minor miscalculation.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:43.510
You seem to be dismissing it
pretty easily.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:47.870
Everything will be
easily taken care of by Gagin.

00:04:54.660 --> 00:04:57.630
I know I should stop these two
from being too reckless.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.060
But I probably can't.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.760
I should try to stay out of their way
at the very least.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:05.220
Tokine.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:10.870
I should ask you to
go somewhere safe.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.170
But will you please stay with me?

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:27.750
I'm the only one who can
build a stairway into the sky.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:28.850
Yeah...

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:33.680
Yoshimori!

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.190
You're strong! You can do it!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:43.730
I know!
Bring it on!

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:00.850
This is it!

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.380
Ketsu!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.490
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:10.650
What?!

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:12.890
- Wow! He did it!
- Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:06:15.070 --> 00:06:17.110
Yoshimori! Take it at an angle!

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:19.510
You can deflect it using less force.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.710
I have to... keep up!

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.100
Ketsu!

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:27.450
You idiot! I said don't take it head on!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.580
I don't care! Shishio is risking his life!

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:34.680
I should do the same and
be able to take it head on!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:45.790
Metsu!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:50.300
There's no end to this.
But...

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:54.070
Why isn't the Yukimura hag
coming out?!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.140
Tokiko! Tokiko!

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.250
Are you all right, Tokiko?!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:08.840
A Shikigami?

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.320
Where is Tokiko?!

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:14.030
My master headed for
the Black Pampas Grass.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.730
The Black Pampas Grass?! Alone?!
Being so reckless!

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:22.400
My master will be fine alone.
You know that. Too.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:28.540
My duty is to protect her
in the event of any emergencies...

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:34.510
If you have a message for my master,
I will relay it to her.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:46.630
Hoi! Joso!

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:49.830
Ketsu!

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:56.500
Toshimori! Shuji-san!
I formed a Kekkai around the houses!

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.070
I will let my Shikigami
deal with the remaining enemies.

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:01.440
But if anything happens,
just run away!

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.770
I'm going to Karasumori!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.940
Father! Please don't overdo it!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:11.250
Grandpa is so amazing.

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:13.950
He surrounded the house
with a huge Kekkai!

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.220
And he made Shikigami on top of that.

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:17.890
Should I give them some tea?

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:19.790
I don't think you need to.

00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:25.300
Master of the Sumimura family!
I am Hiba of the Night Troops.

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:27.930
Pleased to meet you. I have come to-

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:29.900
I know there's something going on!

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:33.160
Um. Where is the master
of the Yukimura family?

00:08:33.370 --> 00:08:35.140
The old lady isn't here.
She's away!

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:39.370
Damn it! If things
got out of hand,

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:42.110
I was told to ask
for Yukimura's help, too!

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.850
What is happening at Karasumori?!

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:47.790
Yes, a horde of Ayakashi
have gathered there.

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:50.660
One's extremely powerful
and rampaging now.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.000
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:08.200
Curses!

00:09:14.220 --> 00:09:15.840
All right! I can do this!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.550
We're even in strength,
but I have the advantage in speed.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.520
I can corner him little by little.

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:28.630
The Flame Tattoo is starting to burn!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:32.290
That Flame Tattoo is a form of restraint.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:36.970
The more you try to
release your powers,

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:40.270
the more it will cause a searing pain
all over your body...

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:44.580
Like I care! I'm going to be
jumping into a sea of fire anyway!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:49.520
He cut me through my shield!

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.760
Yoshimori! What happened to
your fighting spirit you showed me just now?!

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.520
Shut up! Don't talk to me!
I'm trying to concentrate!

00:09:57.830 --> 00:10:00.990
Don't tell me that's all you got!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:07.690
Of course not! I'm going to show
that horse face what I'm made of!

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.060
You can do it, Yoshimori!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.650
What?! They deflected that fireball?!

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:24.740
Now!

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:30.250
All right! Shishio did it!

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:35.560
It can't be! This is impossible!
I was overpowered by a human?!

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.000
This is impossible!

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.300
You'll all pay for this!

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:44.400
I can see it!
I can see his movements!

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:54.110
What?! Now I hear my body
making awful noises!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:57.010
You ruined my life up until now...

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:59.880
Don't give up on me now!

00:11:02.560 --> 00:11:04.110
All right! His shield is gone!

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.090
Good job, Shishio! Go!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:06.950
Ketsu!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.420
Here's the finishing blow!

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.100
Y-You-!!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:34.550
You really should've watched your back
and stayed sharp... like this blade.

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.620
I guess I should ask for your answer.

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:40.120
Are you going to come with us?

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:42.820
Never!

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:44.660
Too bad.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:52.400
You can't obtain freedom unless
you step past the boundary.

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:57.070
So suffer the consequences
of rejecting freedom.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:02.280
Shishio!

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:02.940
Ketsu!

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:08.950
Shishio! Get ahold of yourself!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.850
Gen-kun! Gen-kun!

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.650
Shishio! Open your eyes!

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:18.690
This is unfortunate.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:23.600
If he was a little more courageous,
I would've helped.

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:30.270
I don't get what you're saying!
He had enough courage for all of us!

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:32.510
Don't give me that bull!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:36.850
You just don't know.
He was wavering.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:40.480
I thought we could be good friends
if he came to our side.

00:12:40.890 --> 00:12:42.820
Why, you- Ketsu!

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.750
See ya. I have some hopes for you.

00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:50.290
Wait!

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:54.700
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.730
I'll be waiting.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:01.540
Discard everything and
enter the world of freedom.

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:04.080
You will become stronger that way.

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:05.950
What are you talking about?!

00:13:05.950 --> 00:13:07.210
Yoshimori!

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:09.670
He's still here?!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:12.840
Damn it!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:16.780
I can't lose to humans!

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:20.150
Prepare yourself! I'll blow you away!

00:13:20.360 --> 00:13:21.020
Ketsu!

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:25.130
You horse face!
You'll pay for getting in my way!

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:28.530
You think I'll lose to you?!

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.800
Not good. I have to distract
that horse face somehow!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.540
That's it!
Ketsu!

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:46.180
Metsu!

00:13:55.960 --> 00:13:58.490
Shishio! Shishio! Get ahold of yourself!

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.260
Gen-kun! Gen-kun!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:01.360
Open your eyes!

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:10.510
You're awake!

00:14:11.250 --> 00:14:12.970
What... are you doing?

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:14.500
What?

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:20.550
Don't... mind me. They're coming...

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:32.460
What are you going to do now?
Gagin lost.

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:36.570
This is nothing.
We'll just attack with full force.

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:03.230
Princess. What is the matter?

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:07.560
How long are you going to take?
I'm tired of waiting!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:12.470
Please wait a little longer!
I will definitely present Karasumori to you!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:19.010
It's your fault for taking so long!
If you can't do it, I'll do it myself!

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:21.980
You mustn't. Princess!
If you use your powers now-!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.150
Princess! Please stop!

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:43.170
Wh-What is that?!

00:15:46.810 --> 00:15:50.400
What Negative Energy!
Could this be the master of Kokuboro?!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.910
Shishio, don't worry!
You'll recover if you stay here!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.380
Get ahold of yourself!

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:56.940
Yoshimori! What's wrong?!

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:58.410
It's Shishio...

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.120
He got cut by one of them!

00:16:01.820 --> 00:16:04.290
But he should heal if he stays here, right?

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:10.450
Are you stupid?
You broke the taboo again.

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:13.530
Wait! If he hadn't fought, we would've-

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:14.690
He's not going to survive.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:17.330
What do you mean by that?!

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.100
Why didn't you stop him?!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:23.040
Half-Ayakashi are
still human at their core!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:25.510
He's more vulnerable
than an Ayakashi!

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:29.210
One of the reasons why
complete transformation is forbidden.

00:16:29.850 --> 00:16:32.610
They can hurt themselves
if they go out of control for too long.

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:37.090
No! He didn't go out of control!
He was conscious the whole time!

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:39.950
Either way, he's completely damaged
at the cellular level.

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:44.300
Normally, the cells around his wounds
begin healing immediately,

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:46.390
but their movements are slow.

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:55.440
Princess! Please stop!
Shion! Stop her!

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.010
That's impossible.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:00.370
Ketsu!

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:08.150
Don't worry!
I'll take care of the rest!

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:12.190
Will this... be the grave
for an old warrior?!

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:15.360
I asked the Medical Team to come.

00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:17.300
But I don't know if
they'll make it in time.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.530
One can only hope
this miraculous land will help!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.800
H-Hiba-san...

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:24.260
Shishio! Don't talk!

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:29.610
Tell the Chief... that I am sorry
I couldn't obey his orders...

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:35.710
It's not my job to apologize for you.
You need to get better and do it yourself.

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:37.080
Yes. Sir...

00:17:38.920 --> 00:17:41.010
You did well.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:43.780
My claws...

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:51.990
I finally used them to protect someone...
not hurt them...

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:58.400
Is he crying for me?

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:03.030
What's with that... face?

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:06.650
It's because you're being so wimpy!

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:11.110
It's strange...

00:18:13.920 --> 00:18:15.910
All these memories coming back...

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.760
Are you just gonna give up?!

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.660
Don't you have things
you still want to do with your life?

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:30.960
I wanted to apologize to my big sister...

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:35.040
But it's okay... I'm content...

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:41.840
This feeling!

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.190
That's right! It's the same
as that time with Koya!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:55.160
The moment he accepted his death,
it accelerated!

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.520
No! Don't accept it!

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.830
I still owe you!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.070
Gen-kun. No!

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.060
Open your eyes!

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:08.800
You're so stupid...
You've already paid me back enough...

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.870
Shishio! Shishio!

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.410
Don't call out my name so much.

00:19:17.080 --> 00:19:18.810
I can't sleep...

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:37.830
What is this?!

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.900
What? What's going on?!

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:44.430
What is this?! Karasumori is crying!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:13.930
Princess!

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.180
Princess! You must come to your senses!

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:20.770
What is this horrible feeling?

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.310
It feels like I am being
dragged into an abyss!

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:27.610
Is this really Karasumori?

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:32.260
I feel sick.
There is something wrong with this place.

00:20:32.590 --> 00:20:37.590
It is only your imagination.
It is because you overused your powers.

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:39.790
Really?

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:41.860
You must rest.

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:46.800
Shion! We must retreat!
Recall your troops!

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:52.070
The Princess is ill!
She's sick from using her powers.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:53.670
Fine.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:58.540
If she kept going,
we would've been killed, too.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:03.060
Calling all hands.
The Princess's condition has worsened.

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:07.890
Retreat at once! Retreat at once!

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:12.490
Oh, boy. We're retreating
before we even set foot on Karasumori?

00:21:34.720 --> 00:21:36.710
I could just barely
block the Negative Energy.

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:39.820
But why did Karasumori?

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:43.920
Mukade. Thank you.

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:44.790
Not at all.

00:21:50.600 --> 00:21:53.770
You're late... you're too late!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.040
Handle him with respect.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:04.240
Yes. Sir.

00:22:07.920 --> 00:22:08.910
Wait!

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:13.450
If you must blame someone, blame me.
I'm responsible for this.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.690
Aren't you sad, Big Brother?!

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:17.460
I have no time to be sad!

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:21.960
The Kokuboro who killed Gen
are still after Karasumori!

00:22:23.100 --> 00:22:25.160
I will crush the Kokuboro!

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:27.540
Don't think you're the only one
who's mad!

00:22:28.710 --> 00:22:29.800
I will lead the operation!

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:33.710
If I think you're dragging us down,
I will dismiss you at once!

00:22:46.690 --> 00:22:52.220
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:54.100 --> 00:23:00.130
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:23:00.510 --> 00:23:02.670
"What nerve"

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:06.050
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:09.780
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:16.150
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:21.190
I hate studying,
I like P.E. Okay

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:23.130
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:28.400
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:31.930
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:36.030
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:50.520 --> 00:24:00.870
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
